{"id":"8085e5127aec7739","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-rice-property.md","title":"Rice Property","display":"df-rice-property — Rice Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-rice-property","aliases":["88-df-rice-property"],"display":"df-rice-property — Rice Property","depends_on":["[[88-df-partial-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-rice-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-rice-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rice-property — Rice Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\)</span> (class of unary partial computable functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\)</span> (Rice property predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rice\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\nP\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\n\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land P\\neq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rice\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\nP\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\n\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land P\\neq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>是Rice性质</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元素是部分函数图，因此外延性由集合成员资格自动保证。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(P\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\neq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\">\\(P\\neq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\)</span> 精确表达非平凡性。</li>\n<li>Rice定理：所有Rice性质都是不可判定的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-partial-computable","status":"resolved","id":"b020503ba5d16dce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-computable","status":"resolved","id":"b020503ba5d16dce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1$ (class of unary partial computable functions, see [[88-df-partial-computable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rice\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\nP\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\n\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land P\\neq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"P\\neq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1","display":false}],"bytes":918,"backlinks":[{"id":"596739a9c86dafde","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rice}(P)$ (nontrivial extensional-property predicate, see [[88-df-rice-property]])"},{"id":"27a2cae3c4304ed3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rice}(P)$ (nontrivial extensional-property predicate, see [[88-df-rice-property]])"},{"id":"4aed37dba54730e2","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1$，见 [[88-df-partial-computable]]；$\\mathrm{Rice}(P)$ 见 [[88-df-rice-property]]；$I_P$ 见 [[88-df-index-set]]。"},{"id":"d537b31e66e4fbaf","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rice}(P)$、$I_P$、$\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)$ 分别见 [[88-df-rice-property]]、[[88-df-index-set]]、[[88-df-rice-theorem]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-property]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-